# The Grand Directory (Chapter 3), the entrance halls. From the mire door (south) the front
# hall holds Dex's desk (3-01). West: the yank/put room, a crate and a plate that opens the
# gate up to the Gossip Gallery (3-02, the wall of shouting words). East along the north:
# the golem antechamber (3-03), whose gate opens the Reading Room and the door up to the
# stacks. The catalogue hall (east) keeps the waystone and Cole. After 3-02 a shortcut gate
# joins the front hall to the antechamber, so a reset crate never strands the player.
